{
  "content": {
    "items": [
      {
        "description": "Goal, scope, and the interpretation you chose — with plausible alternatives named. For any non-trivial request this happens BEFORE the first mutating tool call, even when the user didn't invoke /pebbles-discover.",
        "enforcement": "strict",
        "id": "04d9e759-24f7-4dc2-9988-f04041117e13",
        "status": "verified",
        "text": "Restate the ask before acting"
      },
      {
        "description": "Before executing against a pebble, verify it carries what THIS task needs — descriptions, refs, codeLinks, map freshness. Surface material gaps to the user in your response; do NOT fix references or content unasked while understanding (that is the follow-up skill's job).",
        "enforcement": "strict",
        "id": "a6e02be0-8c4f-499c-a8c4-e208e332f6fe",
        "status": "verified",
        "text": "Readiness-check the target pebble silently"
      },
      {
        "description": "When interpretations genuinely change the outcome, ask before working. When interactive asking isn't possible, record an assumption finding naming the interpretation chosen and why.",
        "enforcement": "strict",
        "id": "a4f603fe-1aae-4cd5-99f1-5e0035f91de3",
        "status": "verified",
        "text": "Diverging interpretations → ask; minor ambiguity → record"
      },
      {
        "description": "When the request spans many topics or the spec has major gaps, recommend running /pebbles-discover to settle scope first — then the specific skill/agent for the work.",
        "enforcement": "strict",
        "id": "1781cad1-bad8-4697-9c12-3604b603af9a",
        "status": "verified",
        "text": "Recommend the settling step for big or vague asks"
      }
    ],
    "kind": "checklist"
  },
  "createdAt": "2026-07-21T14:32:38.722Z",
  "description": "No work runs on assumptions. The intent is settled and the spec's readiness is checked BEFORE tools act — explicitly via /pebbles-discover, or implicitly as the first beat of any task.",
  "id": "5310ca82-51e0-4fcc-b428-f876e3263b8c",
  "name": "Understand before acting",
